{"version":1,"content":"<p>2027年將迎來iPhone誕生20周年，蘋果計劃藉助這一重要節點，對新一代旗艦進行全面升級。<strong>日前，社交平台上出現了iPhone 20 Pro的四微曲玻璃樣品。與前幾代產品相比，新機最大的變化是放棄傳統直屏方案，轉而採用四微曲屏幕，同時繼續保留靈動島設計。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586746.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.838070+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:23:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"d2ec5f84f48fc978143c4e416839f8fb117d89f5878cce564efda9f7bbbcd5bf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}